{"id":"vod_bf_8438","vodId":"8438","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"多罗罗2019","name_cn":"多罗罗2019","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-9/351af4d00326cf2607924c26f81125f9.jpg"},"summary":"时为战国。醍醐之国主景光，在某所寺院的大堂中，向12尊鬼神像许愿领土繁荣。作为交换而诞生的景光之后嗣，身体各处都有所欠缺，被视作不祥之子而抛弃到河川之中。时光流逝，鬼神实现了与景光的约定，国家迎来了平安。这样的某天，名为“多罗罗”的年幼盗贼，与某个男人相遇。　　那是鬼，还是人——两臂装有刀剑，全身皆为人造的男人“百鬼丸”，其无光之瞳紧紧盯着袭来的妖魔。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 18:28:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/duoluoluo2019/第15集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://c1.rr